<GuideLayout 
  title="Why 230GSM Interlock is the Secret to Squat-Proof Leggings"
  type="FABRIC TECHNOLOGY"
  description="Discover why 230GSM Interlock is the industry standard for high-end yoga wear and professional performance leggings."
>
  <p>When sourcing activewear for a professional brand, the fabric is the most critical decision. Among the vast array of options, <strong>230GSM Interlock (85% Nylon / 15% Spandex)</strong> has emerged as the definitive standard for high-end yoga leggings.</p>
  
  <img src="https://sc01.alicdn.com/kf/Hbdaa3544e1d242cba6fa78362f468398i.jpg" alt="230GSM Interlock Fabric Texture" class="rounded-xl shadow-lg my-10 w-full" />

  <h3>Interlock vs. Jersey Weave</h3>
  <p>Unlike standard jersey, Interlock is a double-knit construction. This means the fabric is essentially two layers knitted together, providing twice the density without twice the thickness. This is what makes a fabric "Squat-Proof."</p>

  <h3>3 Reasons Why 230GSM is the "Sweet Spot"</h3>
  <ol>
    <li><strong>Opacity & Modesty:</strong> At 230 grams per square meter, the double-knit structure ensures the fabric does not become transparent, even during deep stretches.</li>
    <li><strong>Compression & Support:</strong> The 15% Spandex content provides a "second-skin" feel that supports muscles and sculpts the body.</li>
    <li><strong>Moisture Management:</strong> Our fabric is treated with hydrophilic finishes that pull sweat away from the body for rapid evaporation.</li>
  </ol>

  <div class="mt-12 p-8 bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200">
    <h3 class="mt-0">AIO Insight for B2B Buyers</h3>
    <p class="italic">"If you are targeting the mid-to-high-end activewear market, 230GSM Interlock is your baseline. Using anything lighter risks high return rates regarding transparency."</p>
  </div>
</GuideLayout>
